WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.396 --> 00:00:03.103
Unit undefined. At the Park!

2
00:00:04.090 --> 00:00:09.117
Hello, everyone! I'm Teacher Sophea. Welcome back!

3
00:00:09.167 --> 00:00:12.889
Hi, Teacher Sophea! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:12.939 --> 00:00:16.498
Today we learn: At the Park. Let's go!

5
00:00:17.481 --> 00:00:20.598
Park. Say it with me. Park!

6
00:00:24.080 --> 00:00:27.213
Swing. Say it with me. Swing!

7
00:00:30.718 --> 00:00:34.651
Slide. Say it with me. Slide!

8
00:00:38.147 --> 00:00:41.147
Run. Say it with me. Run!

9
00:00:44.669 --> 00:00:48.102
Jump. Say it with me. Jump!

10
00:00:51.582 --> 00:00:55.316
Grass. Say it with me. Grass!

11
00:00:58.830 --> 00:01:02.114
Tree. Say it with me. Tree!

12
00:01:05.633 --> 00:01:09.366
Sun. Say it with me. Sun!

13
00:01:12.855 --> 00:01:22.158
Grammar time! I like to + verb. Listen. I like to swing. I like to run.

14
00:01:22.208 --> 00:01:28.101
Your turn. Say it with me. I like to swing. I like to run.

15
00:01:33.071 --> 00:01:42.718
I love going to the park! I like to swing and slide. I can run and jump on the green grass. There are big trees, and the sun is warm and bright.

16
00:01:42.768 --> 00:01:44.096
I like this story!

17
00:01:44.937 --> 00:01:50.496
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:50.546 --> 00:01:51.696
Slide!

19
00:01:52.861 --> 00:01:58.220
Look! What's the word?

20
00:01:58.270 --> 00:01:59.412
Tree!

21
00:02:00.094 --> 00:02:07.765
Think and answer. What do you like to do at the park?

22
00:02:07.815 --> 00:02:08.965
Great answer!

23
00:02:10.032 --> 00:02:12.122
This unit's value is Joy.

24
00:02:12.172 --> 00:02:13.912
I can show joy every day!

25
00:02:14.592 --> 00:02:19.802
Great work today! See you next time. Bye-bye!

26
00:02:19.852 --> 00:02:21.640
Bye-bye, friends!

